        {"id": "US-08-AC03", "format": "given_when_then", "text": "Given an Order whose status is submitted, pending or closed, When Accountant attempts to raise an invoice, Then the request is rejected (REQ‑F‑30)."},
        {"id": "US-08-AC04", "format": "condition", "text": "Invoice status can only transition issued → paid (REQ‑F‑50)."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "US-09",
      "type": "functional",
      "statement": "As a Customer, I want to submit a payment against an issued invoice, so that the invoice can be settled.",
