    {"id":"US-04-AC05","format":"condition","text":"Payment method on the order is restricted to bank, card, or cash."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-05","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to change an order’s status according to the allowed workflow, so that the order proceeds through the correct lifecycle.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-05-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status submitted, When the staff receives the order, Then the status changes to pending."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status submitted, When the staff attempts to receive it, Then the system rejects the request and the status remains submitted."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status pending, When the staff marks it as filled, Then the status changes to filled."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC04","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status pending, When the staff attempts to mark it as filled, Then the system rejects the request and the status remains pending."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC05","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status pending, When the staff declines the order, Then the status changes to closed."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC06","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status filled, When the staff ships the order, Then the status changes to shipped."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC07","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with status shipped whose invoice is not paid, When the staff attempts to close the order, Then the system rejects the request and the status remains shipped."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC08","format":"condition","text":"Order status may only transition as follows: submitted → pending → filled → shipped → closed; or submitted → pending → closed."}
  ]},
