    {"id":"US-08-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a payment with status pending, When the accountant rejects it, Then the payment status becomes failed and the invoice and order statuses remain unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-08-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a payment whose status is not pending, When the accountant attempts to confirm or reject it, Then the system rejects the request and the status remains unchanged."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-09","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to close a shipped order whose invoice is paid, so that the order lifecycle ends.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-09-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a shipped order whose associated invoice has status paid, When the staff closes the order, Then the order status becomes closed."},
